依赖(均已存在):camera_detect_frame(buf,&dir);dvp 抓帧那套(照抄 track);
bk7258_lcd_eye_gaze / bk7258_lcd_eye_expr(panel,EYE_EXPR_*,gaze) / bk7258_lcd_eye_blink(panel,gaze);
BK7258_IRQ_YUV_BUF、up_disable_irq/up_enable_irq;TRACK_* 宏(GAZE_MAX/EMA_WEIGHT/SPAN_MIN/MISS_TO_CENTER)。

=== 1) 常量(放 bk7258_camera_track 附近,均可调) ===
